      "id": "recap",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Performance averages are still total ÷ count.\n\nInnings: total runs ÷ innings.\nRun rate: runs ÷ overs.\nBowling average: runs conceded ÷ wickets.\n\nWhen a new performance is added or old performances are removed, update the relevant total and count before dividing.",
